{
  "id": "a2-u04-l03",
  "unit": "a2-u04",
  "order": 3,
  "title": "I never smoke",
  "goal": "Say what you don't do and ask questions in the aorist: içmem, içmez, içer misin?",
  "points": ["gp-aorist-negative", "gp-aorist-forms", "gp-aorist-irregulars"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "The negative aorist is `-mAz`: *içmez* (he doesn't drink). For **I** and **we** the z drops: *içmem*, *içmeyiz*. In questions the ending moves onto `mI`: *İçer misin?*, *İçmez misin?* With *hiç* or *asla* it means **never**: *Hiç et yemem*.",
    "see": "gp-aorist-negative"
  },
  "vocab": [
    {
      "tr": "asla",
      "en": "never (with a negative verb)",
      "pos": "adv",
      "card": "fc-0221"
    },
    {
      "tr": "sigara",
      "en": "cigarette",
      "pos": "noun",
      "card": "fc-0818"
    },
    {
      "tr": "sigara içmek",
      "en": "to smoke",
      "pos": "verb"
    },
    {
      "tr": "balık",
      "en": "fish",
      "pos": "noun",
      "card": "fc-0641"
    },
    {
      "tr": "kullanmak",
      "en": "to use; to drive (a car)",
      "pos": "verb",
      "card": "fc-0147"
    },
    {
      "tr": "spor yapmak",
      "en": "to do sports, to exercise",
      "pos": "verb"
    },
    {
      "tr": "Bilmem.",
      "en": "I don't know. I wouldn't know.",
      "pos": "phrase"
    }
  ],
